tbfnote1"><label>a</label><p>Association is adjusted for maternal race (white, black, Hispanic and other) and birth order (number of live births prior to index child). Maternal education (&#x02a7d;HS, &#x0003e;HS &#x0003c;college grad, &#x02a7e;college grad), household income (&#x0003c;&#x00024;30&#x02009;000, &#x00024;30&#x02009;000&#x02013;&#x00024;75&#x02009;000, &#x0003e;&#x00024;75&#x02009;000), maternal age at time of index child's birth, child gender, smoking during pregnancy and birth weight were not significant confounders and are not included in the adjusted model.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>